                                          │ ▸ · 3 tools: Read ×2, Bash                                                 │
                                          │ ✎ • Context: go vet ./... came back clean. doc.go describes a pure drawing │
                                          │      package: a pipeline box on the left, agent events on the right, and n │
                                          │     o                                                                      │
                                          │      disk reads. .golangci.yml enables funlen, gocyclo (threshold 15) and  │
                                          │      lll.                                                                  │
                                          │   • Most important, gocyclo: Rendering code branches on step state,        │
                                          │      terminal width, truncation, wrapping and empty or overflow cases.     │
                                          │      Those branches pile up in a single draw function, and each combinatio │
                                          │     n                                                                      │
                                          │      needs its own test. Capping complexity at 15 pushes that logic into   │
                                          │      small, separately testable helpers.                                   │
                                          │   • Second, funlen: Layout code tends to grow into long, sequential "draw  │
                                          │      everything" functions even when each branch is simple, so it catches  │
                                          │     a                                                                      │
                                          │      different problem than gocyclo. Short functions keep the left-box and │
                                          │      right-events panes composable, which suits a library that only draws  │
                                          │      what the caller gives it. lll is mostly cosmetic, so I ranked it last │
